#! program build/docs-examples/bin/cb_trajectory
#! from    5
#! frames  300
#! poster  299
#! crop    0 0 720 560
# a trajectory in 3-D growing while the solver runs (the Lorenz system, three steps a frame); a right drag across the
# plot turns the box one way, then back; the wheel zooms in a step
0   move 650 520
40  move 300 260 20
70  down right
74  move 450 270 40
120 up right
140 move 420 230 10
160 down right
164 move 330 220 40
210 up right
230 wheel 0 1
250 move 650 520 20
